DISCUSSION AND FINDINGS 5. Sura 4 Ayat 3 of the Holy Quran throws light on second marriage by a Muslim, which is reproduced below:
"If ye fear that ye shall not Be able to deal justly With the orphans, Marry women of your choice, Two, or three, or four;
But if ye fear that ye shall not Be able to do justly (with them), Then only one, or (a captive) That your right hands posses.
